mmendationid": "152610443", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039020399", "personaname": "Genya", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198039020399/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 15235, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12251, "last_played": 1754699036, "avatar": "ea41d5012780845b7de13ee522010616a9cc35c6"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've been very pleased with Remnant 2 overall. The gameplay is challenging, the bosses are unique and entertaining, it looks fantastic and has a stellar soundtrack, and the with all of the different builds you can play around with the game has very high replayability.", "timestamp_created": 1701382481, "timestamp_updated": 1701382481, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152609878", "author": {"steamid": "76561198130641864", "personaname": "Raging Jebus", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198130641864/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 81, "playtime_forever": 9849, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5207, "last_played": 1728777909, "avatar": "637890e633ce7854feb405244083db28688ada8e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Remnant should be a benchmark for other co-op games.  \n10:10 would recommend", "timestamp_created": 1701381844, "timestamp_updated": 1701381844, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152609706", "author": {"steamid": "76561198033687948", "personaname": "RubiCoN49Bc49", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198033687948/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 531, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 367, "last_played": 1701798600, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've only played a handful of hours so I'm very fresh to this series, but I really like it so far.  I'm a big Souls fan including Elden Ring (completed them all), this game (if not played on hardest mode) is definitely an easier Souls model, no denying that fact.  If you really like the heavier challenges that the Souls series brings this game may not be for you, but if you don't get too picky about the difficulty of the game, it's certainly plenty of fun to still play through.  Decent creature development, fun weapons and loot, and I find myself wanting to come back to it every day to continue my journey.  I came into this game completely blind as I never played the first installment, so I unfortunately cannot compare the two, sorry!", "timestamp_created": 1701381641, "timestamp_updated": 1701381641, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152606366", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061937241", "personaname": "Apple Prince", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/penguinwitdowns/", "num_games_owned": 100, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2115, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2111, "last_played": 1701461592, "avatar": "3065d5ac7a7bc900359862bfa9d53f9212bd41e3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Issues that occurred in Remnant were addressed in the Remnant 2. Devs listened to community feedback and released a sequel to their already fantastic game. DLC is fantastic.", "timestamp_created": 1701379789, "timestamp_updated": 1701379789, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152604148", "author": {"steamid": "76561198055723928", "personaname": "Cainiscool1", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198055723928/", "num_games_owned": 683, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4676, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3241, "last_played": 1779974224, "avatar": "02ed8eb503eb871df2518bfd45a9a96696b71471"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just as good as the first game, with more bosses to fight, weapons to use, and a good boy you can pet.", "timestamp_created": 1701377177, "timestamp_updated": 1701377177, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47413790225982666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152603695", "author": {"steamid": "76561197961100044", "personaname": "ManOnAMission", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AManOnAMission/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 6138, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 827, "last_played": 1780677655, "avatar": "2502d4cccda215bb6bb405ec16b97019c50fe02b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great looter-shooter-souls-like with plenty to explore and many options to revisit. \nAlthough it runs smoother on PS5, it's 